OL,3,GNEWSANuclear test veterans             
OL,4,Ainvestigation 'a watershed moment'     
OL,6,FAn academic who has worked with nuclear
OL,7,Ftest veterans and their families said  
OL,8,Fan independent investigation into their
OL,9,Fexperiences is a "watershed moment".   
OL,11,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has        
OL,12,Fannounced an investigation into the    
OL,13,Fhealth legacy of Britain's Cold War-era
OL,14,Fatomic programme and ordered an        
OL,15,Findependent panel to assess the        
OL,16,Fpotential impact of testing exercises  
OL,17,Fin the 1950s and 1960s.                
OL,19,FBurnham said the panel, which will be  
OL,20,Fmodelled on the investigation into the 
OL,21,FHillsborough disaster, would give "full
OL,22,Fanswers".                              
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
