OL,3,GNEWSANuclear test veterans             
OL,4,Ainvestigation 'a watershed moment'     
OL,6,FDr Jonathan Hogg, from the University  
OL,7,Fof Liverpool, said veterans had        
OL,8,Fsuffered "complex trauma" and needed to
OL,9,Fknow "all available information".      
